From: Tim Douglas <me@timdoug.com>
Subject: [PATCH] configure: the C33 target

Recognise c33* targets as ARCH=c33, the Seiko Epson S1C33 (PE core)
under no-MMU Linux with FDPIC.

Signed-off-by: Tim Douglas <me@timdoug.com>

diff --git a/configure b/configure
index bc9fbe4..597a488 100755
--- a/configure
+++ b/configure
@@ -333,6 +333,7 @@ m68k*) ARCH=m68k ;;
 mips64*|mipsisa64*) ARCH=mips64 ;;
 mips*) ARCH=mips ;;
 microblaze*) ARCH=microblaze ;;
+c33*) ARCH=c33 ;;
 or1k*) ARCH=or1k ;;
 powerpc64*|ppc64*) ARCH=powerpc64 ;;
 powerpc*|ppc*) ARCH=powerpc ;;
